('P01','preparation count per truly host-admitted frozen attempt identity, across client context/port aliases','attempts_used <2 AND ever_trial_exposure_reserved_or_task_drawn ==false',2,'preparations/frozen host attempt','At most2 explicit preparations in this host-admitted frozen attempt before any reservation/draw; no auto retry. A genuinely new host-admitted attempt may prepare anew; changing a client string is not new admission.','Unbounded setup loops, client strings resetting budget, or incorrectly locking every future legitimate attempt on this page.','Project workload/UX choice, not literature count.','Pilot burden, false rejection, lifecycle changes.'),
('P02','clock probe progress','positive_advance_count ==16 AND perf_elapsed<=20 AND resource_wall_elapsed<=20 AND reads<=262144',16,'positive advances','Completion at elapsed==20 and/or reads==262144 is allowed if16 positives and all other probe rules pass. Reaching a cap with fewer than16 fails; unknown blocks, never fallback60.','Nonadvancing/coarse clock interpreted as precise or free work.','Project preliminary observation length; HRT only supports possible coarsening.','Target privacy/browser/timer observations.'),
('P03','one clock probe resource budget','observed perf elapsed<=20 AND resource-wall elapsed<=20 AND performance.now reads<=262144',{'elapsedMs':20,'maxReads':262144,'resourceWallCheckEveryReads':256},'ms / calls','Exceeding any cap fails even if16 positives were read. At a cap,16 positives may complete if all other rules pass; fewer than16 fails without an extra read. Negative/nonfinite measurement clock or backward resource wall clock also blocks.','Unbounded busy polling.','Project bounded-work proposal; observed deadlines are not a hard physical CPU limit because one API call cannot be preempted.','Probe cost on target devices; coarse/unknown wall guard.'),
