('D02','entry lag from shared RAF marker','0<=entry-rAF<=0.25*P',0.25,'fraction of frozen P','Reject outside budget; retain signed raw, do not clamp negative values.','Late callback hidden behind on-time marker.','Project25% of period, roughly4.17/2.08ms at ideal60/120.','Real entry lag/coarsening; unknown alignment blocks.'),
('D03','work from callback entry to draw-command return','rawWork=return-entry>=0; chargedWork=rawWork+0.25; chargedWork<=0.20*P',{'workPeriodFraction':0.20,'measurementReserveMs':0.25},'fraction / ms','Keep raw0 and censored flag; charge0.25 rather than zero cost. Reserve is engineering accounting, not measured upper bound. Failed/unknown probe blocks.','Coarse-clock0 treated as zero CPU work; ignoring monitoring/pre-draw work.','Project20% work budget plus0.25ms reserve, not GPU guarantee; entire entry-to-return work included.','Probe and actual mask/dot workload feasibility/false rejection.'),
('D04','commandStart span against marker span for every k including off','abs((startk-start_on)-(rk-r_on))<=0.5',0.5,'ms','Reject beyond budget; actual signed clocks retained. With F02, command span residual to kP can be as large as1ms.','Command latency drift despite regular markers.','Project extra0.5ms alignment budget; not physical exposure tolerance.','Measured draw clocks and wider derived software envelope.'),
